title: POI_01
---
Nothing can be seen in the distance; the darkness obscures the view of anything one might want to see.
===

title: POI_02
---
There are bloodstains on the door and on the floor. They look fresh.
===

title: POI_03
---
Beds and furniture creating a barricade

It appears that the main entrance to the deck has been blocked with various pieces of furniture.
===

title: POI_04
---
I trail blood-covered food cans that lead to the kneeling enemy.
===

title: POI_05
---
The whole place is littered with clothes, books, and various other things. There's even some blood.

It looks like someone had to run from here and got caught in a fight.
===

title: POI_06
---
Some boxes with M.E.R.I. rations don't appear to have been used, but they are all open.
===

title: POI_07
---
Water is overflowing from a pipe in the ceiling.
Moving through here will be slower while the water is present.

Combat that takes place while the water is still flowing will also incur a speed penalty.
===

title: POI_08
---
The room is poorly lit, which makes it difficult to see until the lights are turned on.
===

title: POI_09
---
Several boxes are stacked, some empty and others half-open. They bear the M.E.R.I. logo and contain food rations.

There is a lot of blood and a general mess.
===

title: POI_10
---
Several tables and chairs were secured with two large metal gates, creating a blockage that separates the hallway.
===

title: POI_11
---
Water will come out of the toilets, making it impossible to see if there's anything inside.
===

title: POI_12
---
Someone created a barricade using beds and wardrobes to separate the rooms.

There's a lot of blood in them.
===

title: POI_13
---
A graffiti of a cat on the wall.

Next to it, a makeshift bed with some pillows and a jar of food.
===

title: POI_14
---
Several water pipes don't appear to be working properly.
===

title: POI_15
---
A fault in the pipes is causing a water leak.
===

title: POI_16
---
This area will be quite flooded.
Moving through here will be slower while the water is still present.

Combats that take place while the water is still in will also have a speed penalty.
===

title: POI_17
---
We'll find women's underwear scattered all over the room
===

title: POI_18
---
There are several pots on the unlit stovetops. They look like they're making stew.

Several cans are scattered across the counters and floor, all labeled M.E.R.I.
===

title: POI_19
---
Several broken plates and kitchen utensils scattered everywhere
===

title: POI_20
---
The dining room tables and chairs appear to have been the scene of a fight.
===
